  "goodToKnow": "Schlampig means sloppy or careless (schlampig arbeiten, schlampige Recherche) and slovenly or scruffy in appearance. Die Schlamperei is sloppiness, often blamed for errors in bureaucracy. In Austria, schlampig is a common everyday word. Synonyms: nachlässig, unordentlich, schludrig. The opposite is sorgfältig (careful) or ordentlich (neat)."
